      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "THAI BUTTERFLY (6) hit the ground running from an outside draw with a fast early split, holding on for a minor placing when third and beaten 4 lengths at this track over 300m in 17.09. Some good form is emerging from her last run. Sure to be about the mark. WANT SOME (2) wasn't far away at the finish when 4th and beaten only 2.25 lengths (17.31) at this track. Expected to feature in the finish. SKY BLAZER (1) jumps from the inside draw. Latest effort finished 7th on August 12 over 300m at this track behind Blazing Girl beaten 3 lengths (17.42) in a Bottom Up - Grade 5. Can hit the frame with the right run. ASCEND HIBISCUS (5) is worth including after a top-three finish in a tight contest most recently.",
